{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09045","headline":"还阙首途寄精舍亲友 · 韦应物","name":"还阙首途寄精舍亲友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"休沐日云满，冲然将罢观。\n严车候门侧，晨起正朝冠。\n山泽含余雨，川涧注惊湍。\n揽辔遵东路，廻首一长叹。\n居人已不见，高阁在林端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09045.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09045","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}